000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. CLMFEED.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE CLAIMS SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* CLMFEED  CLAIMS MASTER FEED FROM POSTGRES       CLMDAILY STEP005
000600*
000700* SINCE THE 2024 MIGRATION THE SYSTEM OF RECORD FOR CLAIMS IS
000800* POSTGRES claimsdb (claims.claim). THE CICS INQUIRY CLMI STILL
000900* READS VSAM CORV.CLMMAST, SO THIS PROGRAM APPLIES THE DAY'S
001000* CHANGES TO CLMMAST FROM CORV.CLM.FEED, AN UNLOAD OF VIEW
001100* claims.v_claim_mainframe_feed (CHANGES IN THE LAST 2 DAYS).
001200* THE UNLOAD AND THE SFTP PUSH TO CORV.CLM.FEED ARE DONE BY A
001300* claims-platform JOB "claims-mainframe-feed"; ITS SOURCE IS NOT
001400* IN THIS LIBRARY.
001500* FEED RECORD = CLMREC LAYOUT. NAME, PHONE AND DESCRIPTION ARE
001600* NOT IN THE FEED: THEY STAY AS THEY WERE AT MIGRATION, SO CLMI
001700* SHOWS A STALE CLAIMANT NAME FOR CLAIMS OPENED AFTER 2024.
001800* EXISTING KEY -> REWRITE, NEW KEY -> WRITE. NOTHING IS DELETED.
001900*================================================================
002000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002200 FILE-CONTROL.
002300     SELECT FEED-FILE ASSIGN TO CLMFEED
002400         FILE STATUS IS WS-FEED-FS.
002500     SELECT CLMMAST ASSIGN TO CLMMAST
002600         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
002700         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
002800         RECORD KEY IS CLM-NUMBER
002900         FILE STATUS IS WS-CLMMAST-FS.
003000 DATA DIVISION.
003100 FILE SECTION.
003200 FD  FEED-FILE
003300     RECORDING MODE IS F.
003400 01  FEED-REC.
003500     05  FEED-NUMBER             PIC X(14).
003600     05  FEED-POL-NUMBER         PIC X(12).
003700     05  FEED-LINE-CODE          PIC X(03).
003800     05  FEED-STATUS             PIC X(03).
003900     05  FEED-LOSS-DATE          PIC 9(08).
004000     05  FEED-CLOSED-DATE        PIC 9(08).
004100     05  FEED-RESERVE-AMT        PIC 9(09)V99.
004200     05  FEED-PAID-AMT           PIC 9(09)V99.
004300     05  FEED-FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9V999.
004400     05  FEED-ADJUSTER-ID        PIC X(08).
004500 FD  CLMMAST.
004600     COPY CLMREC.
004700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004800 01  WS-FEED-FS                  PIC X(02).
004900 01  WS-CLMMAST-FS               PIC X(02).
005000 01  WS-EOF-SW                   PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
005100     88  WS-EOF                  VALUE 'Y'.
005200 01  WS-COUNTS.
005300     05  WS-READ-CNT             PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
005400     05  WS-NEW-CNT              PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
005500     05  WS-UPD-CNT              PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
005600     05  WS-ERR-CNT              PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
005700 01  WS-EDIT-CNT                 PIC Z(8)9.
005800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005900 0000-MAIN.
006000     OPEN INPUT FEED-FILE I-O CLMMAST
006100     PERFORM 8000-READ-FEED
006200     PERFORM 2000-APPLY UNTIL WS-EOF
006300     CLOSE FEED-FILE CLMMAST
006400     MOVE WS-READ-CNT TO WS-EDIT-CNT
006500     DISPLAY 'CLMFEED RECORDS READ    ' WS-EDIT-CNT
006600     MOVE WS-NEW-CNT TO WS-EDIT-CNT
006700     DISPLAY 'CLMFEED CLAIMS ADDED    ' WS-EDIT-CNT
006800     MOVE WS-UPD-CNT TO WS-EDIT-CNT
006900     DISPLAY 'CLMFEED CLAIMS UPDATED  ' WS-EDIT-CNT
007000     IF WS-ERR-CNT > ZERO
007100         MOVE 8 TO RETURN-CODE
007200     END-IF
007300     GOBACK.
007400 2000-APPLY.
007500     ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT
007600     MOVE FEED-NUMBER TO CLM-NUMBER
007700     READ CLMMAST
007800         INVALID KEY
007900             INITIALIZE CLM-RECORD
008000             MOVE FEED-NUMBER TO CLM-NUMBER
008100             PERFORM 2100-MOVE-FIELDS
008200             WRITE CLM-RECORD
008300                 INVALID KEY ADD 1 TO WS-ERR-CNT
008400                 NOT INVALID KEY ADD 1 TO WS-NEW-CNT
008500             END-WRITE
008600         NOT INVALID KEY
008700             PERFORM 2100-MOVE-FIELDS
008800             REWRITE CLM-RECORD
008900                 INVALID KEY ADD 1 TO WS-ERR-CNT
009000                 NOT INVALID KEY ADD 1 TO WS-UPD-CNT
009100             END-REWRITE
009200     END-READ
009300     PERFORM 8000-READ-FEED.
009400 2100-MOVE-FIELDS.
009500     MOVE FEED-POL-NUMBER   TO CLM-POL-NUMBER
009600     MOVE FEED-LINE-CODE    TO CLM-LINE-CODE
009700     MOVE FEED-STATUS       TO CLM-STATUS
009800     MOVE FEED-LOSS-DATE    TO CLM-LOSS-DATE
009900     MOVE FEED-CLOSED-DATE  TO CLM-CLOSED-DATE
010000     MOVE FEED-RESERVE-AMT  TO CLM-RESERVE-AMT
010100     MOVE FEED-PAID-AMT     TO CLM-PAID-AMT
010200     MOVE FEED-FRAUD-SCORE  TO CLM-FRAUD-SCORE
010300     MOVE FEED-ADJUSTER-ID  TO CLM-ADJUSTER-ID.
010400 8000-READ-FEED.
010500     READ FEED-FILE
010600         AT END SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
010700     END-READ.
